WEBVTT - webconsulting Redaktion: overview film (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.702
One page, four languages, a dozen images, and a
deadline.

2
00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:17.558
Redaktion is a calm Mac workspace for TYPO3.
Your drafts stay on your Mac. TYPO3 stays in
charge of publishing.

3
00:00:18.808 --> 00:00:25.560
Pages look the way TYPO3 shows them. Language
tabs count what is already translated.

4
00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:34.930
The page assistant places a new page, sets its
URL path and translations, and keeps it hidden
until you publish.

5
00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:43.803
Elements come from TYPO3’s own wizard, Content
Blocks included, filtered by the rules of each
column.

6
00:00:44.853 --> 00:00:51.788
Translations use TYPO3’s own command, and the
original text sits right under each field.

7
00:00:52.838 --> 00:01:00.896
Link pages, their content, files and records.
Links keep TYPO3’s format and show their titles.

8
00:01:01.946 --> 00:01:10.422
The media library works on TYPO3’s file list,
and every image gets its own alternative text
where it is used.

9
00:01:11.472 --> 00:01:18.485
News keeps its calm writing surface, with local
drafts that survive an offline restart.

10
00:01:19.785 --> 00:01:24.526
Redaktion, by webconsulting. Ask us for a
demonstration.
